# Crystal Imperium play test: with Heart & Soul's randomizer on for wild Pokemon (RANDOMIZER and
# WILD set to RANDOM, MAP SEEDED left ON), DexNav lists Route 29's randomized Pokemon (one per
# encounter slot, so the land row is full), and every wild battle is one of them. Before 0.5.1,
# DexNav listed the unrandomized Hoothoot and Rattata.
!new_game(random_wild=True)
!give_mon(155, 5)
!warp(0, 11, 0)
!walkto(34, 14, "yx")
!start_menu("DEXNAV")
wait 120
shot 01_dexnav_randomized.png
!snap_dexnav_rows("randomized")
!tally_species_not_in("unrandomized", "SPECIES_HOOTHOOT", "SPECIES_RATTATA", addr="*{sDexNavUiDataPtr}+6")
!tally_species_not_in("unrandomized", "SPECIES_HOOTHOOT", "SPECIES_RATTATA", addr="*{sDexNavUiDataPtr}+8")
expecttally unrandomized 1 2
press B
wait 200
press B
wait 60
savestate route29.ss
!wild_variety_sample("random", 12, state="route29.ss", listed="randomized")
expecttally random_not_listed 0 0
